ちよりゃん！
Chiyoryan!

660
00:55:57,080 --> 00:55:59,080
みなみゃん！
Minamyan!

661
00:55:59,080 --> 00:56:01,380
とろにゃん！
Toronyan!

662
00:56:01,380 --> 00:56:06,380
ありがとう！そしてこの場にはいないんですけど、振付師のMiU先生、
Thank you! Also, though they aren't here right now, my choreographers: MiU-sensei,

663
00:56:06,380 --> 00:56:08,380
Chisato先生！
Chisato-sensei,

664
00:56:08,380 --> 00:56:11,380
