Ayaka-sensei for tap dancing,

665
00:56:11,380 --> 00:56:14,380
ポッピンの、TODO先生！
TODO-sensei for popping,

666
00:56:14,380 --> 00:56:17,380
ダンス監修、YUKA先生！
YUKA-sensei for dance supervision,

667
00:56:17,380 --> 00:56:20,380
ボーカル監修、Maria先生！
and Maria-sensei for vocal supervision!

668
00:56:20,380 --> 00:56:22,680
